    "work_id": "anf-works/passion-of-the-scillitan-martyrs",
    "canonical_ref": "PassScill.27",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Saturninus the proconsul ordered it to be declared by the herald: Speratus, Nartzalus, Cittinus, Veturius, Felix, Aquilinus, Lætantius, Januaria, Generosa, Vestia, Donata and Secunda, I have ordered to be executed.",
